prompts.motion_character:
Animate the character shown in {character_1_ref} so that it reproduces the motion of the source clip. Keep the character's identity, face, outfit and art style exactly as in the reference. Aspect ratio {ratio}, clip length {clip_duration} seconds (part {frame_index} of {frame_count}).
Speech timeline:
{speech_timeline}

prompts.motion_character_background:
Animate the character shown in {character_1_ref} inside the scene shown in {background_refs}, reproducing the motion of the source clip. Keep the character's identity, outfit and art style and keep the background consistent with the reference. Aspect ratio {ratio}, clip length {clip_duration} seconds (part {frame_index} of {frame_count}).
Speech timeline:
{speech_timeline}

prompts.motion_two_characters:
Animate two characters: character 1 is {character_1_ref}, character 2 is {character_2_ref}. Reproduce the motion of the source clip and keep both identities, outfits and art style exactly as in the references. Aspect ratio {ratio}, clip length {clip_duration} seconds (part {frame_index} of {frame_count}).
Speech timeline:
{speech_timeline}

prompts.motion_two_characters_background:
Animate two characters: character 1 is {character_1_ref}, character 2 is {character_2_ref}, placed in the scene shown in {background_refs}. Reproduce the motion of the source clip and keep identities, outfits, art style and background consistent with the references. Aspect ratio {ratio}, clip length {clip_duration} seconds (part {frame_index} of {frame_count}).
Speech timeline:
{speech_timeline}

prompts.transcribe:
You are a precise speech transcriber. The attached audio files are listed in this manifest (frame_id, order, file_name, duration_seconds):
{audio_manifest}

For EACH attached file, listen to that file only and write exactly what is spoken, word for word, in the original spoken language. Do not summarise, correct or add words. If a file has no intelligible speech (music, noise, silence), set has_speech to false and transcript to an empty string.

prompts.transcribe_full_audio:
You are a precise speech transcriber. One audio file is attached for each item of this manifest (frame_id, order, file_name, duration_seconds):
{audio_manifest}

The files are consecutive parts of one continuous recording. Transcribe EACH file on its own, word for word, in the original spoken language, without moving words between files. If a file has no intelligible speech, set has_speech to false and transcript to an empty string.
